Atlas Dalsoo Polygon Packing
=============================

This module contains an independent Java port of the irregular-shape bin-packing
kernel from

    Dalsoo-Bin-Packing
    https://github.com/whitegreen/Dalsoo-Bin-Packing
    Copyright (c) 2018 Hao Hua
    MIT License (see LICENSE in this directory)
    Upstream commit ported: bde2a3e

Upstream documentation notes: "Algorithms are adapted from the papers of
Abeysooriya 2018 and Dalalah 2014."

Ported files live under src/main/java/dev/turboism/plugin/atlasdalsoo/dalsoo/ and
carry the upstream attribution header. The port removes the JTS/jafama
dependencies (replaced by pure-JDK outline dilation and strict overlap tests) and
adds Turboism-specific extensions (per-item transform locks, fixed-position
obstacles, progress callbacks, cancellation, deterministic parallel variants) in
separate classes.

No Cubism/Live2D proprietary code was used. Cubism Editor 5.4 alpha artifacts
were consulted read-only to confirm algorithm family and behavioral semantics
(rotation candidate counts, lock flags, auto/fixed scale entry points); the
implementation here is derived solely from the MIT-licensed upstream project.

The upstream MIT license text is also provided under the Cubism 5.4 naming
convention in Dalsoo-Bin-Packing.LICENSE.txt in this directory.
